# --- Andromeda planning artifacts ---
# Track plans (architecture, 6 specialist plans, route, project.yaml, state.yaml,
# context/ living artifacts) — they are the source of truth for the CLAUDE.md ecosystem.
# The audit-trail run directories are tracked too (operator decision 2026-08-14):
# they hold the forensic record — fan-out proposals, amendment and decision records —
# that the per-chunk folders do not carry.
# Code-graph DB cache (v3 — derived from rust-analyzer SCIP; rebuilt from code, never committed).
.andromeda/cache/
# Python bytecode from the code-graph pipeline (scripts/code-graph.py).
scripts/__pycache__/

# --- Rust ---
# Build output
target/

# rustfmt backups
**/*.rs.bk

# DuckDB temp-storage spill files (per-process; on crash/abort leaked under
# the executing crate's working dir; can hit 40+ GB on Windows after a
# query like Q7 recursive-CTE buffer overrun) — discovered chunk #79.
**/.tmp/

# Cargo.lock policy: COMMIT for binary crates (reproducible builds);
# pulse-app is the binary root, so Cargo.lock IS committed.
# (Do NOT add Cargo.lock to .gitignore.)

# --- Tauri ---
# Updater Minisign keys (NEVER commit private keys)
*.key
~/.tauri/*.key
**/.tauri/*.key
src-tauri/target/

# Tauri 2 auto-generated capability schemas (regenerated by tauri-build per build)
pulse-app/gen/

# --- Node / webview frontend ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
coverage/
.parcel-cache/
.turbo/
.vite/
# Stray repo-root taurpc/Specta bindings export — the canonical webview is
# pulse-app/ui/ (tauri frontendDist resolves under pulse-app); some export
# invocation writes bindings to a repo-root-relative ui/src/bindings/ under a
# repo-root CWD. Anchored (/ui/) so it never matches pulse-app/ui/.
/ui/

# Frontend env files
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env*

# --- IDE ---
*.iml
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json.example
.fleet/

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store

# --- Windows ---
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Code-signing certificates ---
*.p12
*.pem
*.cer
*.pfx

# --- Test artifacts ---
proptest-regressions/*.txt.bk
.test-logs/
# cargo-llvm-cov output (workspace-root lcov.info from `cargo xtask test:coverage`)
lcov.info
# A11y / Playwright / Lighthouse / pa11y output directories
pulse-app/ui/playwright-report/
pulse-app/ui/test-results/
pulse-app/ui/.lighthouseci/
pulse-app/ui/pa11y-results/
# Screen-reader manual-pass JSONL output (chunk #14 scaffold; redundant
# under pulse-app/ui/test-results/ above but listed explicitly for
# discoverability of the dedicated SR sub-dir)
pulse-app/ui/test-results/a11y-sr/

# --- Andromeda-pulse runtime data (when accidentally created in repo) ---
~/.andromeda-pulse/
.andromeda-pulse/

# --- Claude Code local settings ---
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/backup/
# Runtime PID lock file (scheduled tasks; ephemeral; per-session)
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# --- Research spikes (throwaway / never commits to main) ---
# Chunk #69 Phase A Drain spike validation (per .andromeda/decisions/pre-d2-drain-spike.md).
# Spike code never commits to main; the findings doc is the only artifact that does.
crates/triage-experimental/

# --- Local LLM model files (NEVER commit; multi-GB binary blobs) ---
# Per arch §Established Decisions [LLM Inference Runtime — L4 interpretation layer]:
# user supplies а Llama-3.x / similar GGUF checkpoint via
# ANDROMEDA_PULSE_MODEL_PATH env var. The model file is NEVER part of the
# repo (~2GB for а 3B Q4 quant; ~5-8GB for а 7B Q4 quant). Both root-level
# AI-Model/ (user convention) AND any *.gguf anywhere in the tree are
# excluded — defense-in-depth against а 2GB blob entering git history.
AI-Model/
**/*.gguf
**/*.safetensors

# chunk #99 a11y regression-detector run artifact (embeds absolute user paths; regenerated per run)
pulse-app/ui/tests-a11y/regression-set.json

# Local scratch spikes (isolated own-[workspace] crates; keep out of the code-graph dirty check)
experiments/

# --- Future-version incubator (untracked planning material; not part of the current version) ---
# 0.4.0 research/positioning docs; kept local + untracked until promoted into a version
# (operator decision at the 2026-07-05-legible-labeled-constellation wrap — keep out of the 0.3.0 chunk commits).
andromeda-pulse-0.4.0-incubator/
